  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Plinio, so-called Villa of Pliny</p>\r\n<p>The villa site is located along the Via Severiana in the location known as \"Tenuta Palombara\", within the grounds of the Tenuta di Castelfusano.</p>",
